<title>USA: SunAmerica Inc Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>SunAmerica Inc Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Six months ended</p>
<p>					March 31,	  March 31,</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>NET INVESTMENT INCOME</p>
<p>			    152,004   112,294    295,673    214,420</p>
<p>NET REALIZED INVESTMENT LOSSES</p>
<p>			    (9,442)   (3,589)   (18,746)    (2,185)</p>
<p> TOTAL FEE INCOME	65,469    55,367    126,331    105,212</p>
<p> NET INCOME		86,834    68,241    167,202    133,027</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE	0.62	0.48	 1.20	 0.95</p>
<p>NET EARNINGS APPLICABLE TO</p>
<p>COMMON STOCK</p>
<p>(used in the computation of</p>
<p>earnings per share)</p>
<p>			     84,803    65,358    163,112    127,261</p>
<p>AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>			    136,196   135,929    135,566    133,710</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 net results include net realized investment gains and losses.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 operating earnings were $0.67 per share versus $0.50 per share in Q2 1996.</p>
<p>Operating earnings for the first six months of 1997 were $1.29 per share verus $0.96 per share in the first six months of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
